      "options": {
        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<div style=\"border-left:6px solid #1A3A5E;background:#FFFFFF;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:4px;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(26,58,94,.10)\"><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:700;color:#1A3A5E\">Batch Ingestion · landing files → bronze layer</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#4A5A6A;margin-top:2px\">Every CSV dropped in data/landing/ is detected by the watchdog file-watcher, triggers Airflow and is COPY-loaded into bronze in 50k-row chunks. Load duration = end − start of read + parse + insert.</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#356895;margin-top:6px;font-weight:600\">Use the Refresh and Source-domain filters above · click any source bar to focus on it · 'Reset filters' (top right) clears them</div></div>"
